 "AnimatedBox": "## AnimatedBox — Wraps children in an entrance or attention animation.\nTag: <AnimatedBox> (group: animation)\nProps (? = optional):\n- animation: AnimationPreset — The animation preset to apply\n- trigger?: AnimationTrigger — What triggers the animation\n- isActive?: boolean — When trigger=\"state\", controls whether the animation is active\n- duration?: number — Duration of the animation in milliseconds\n- delay?: number — Delay before the animation starts in milliseconds\n- easing?: string — CSS easing function\n- children: node — Content to animate\nTypes the props use:\n- AnimationPreset = | 'fadeIn' | 'fadeUp' | 'fadeDown' | 'fadeLeft' | 'fadeRight' | 'scaleIn' | 'slideUp' | 'slideDown' | 'bounceIn'\n- AnimationTrigger = 'mount' | 'visible' | 'hover' | 'state'\nChildren: accepts child content.\nEvery component also takes style and className.\nMinimal usage: <AnimatedBox animation={animation}>…</AnimatedBox>",
