 "DataGrid": "## DataGrid — A large, virtualised data table with sorting and selection.\nTag: <DataGrid> (group: minimal)\nProps (? = optional):\n- columns: DataGridColumn<T>[]\n- data: T[]\n- keyField?: keyof T | ((row: T) => string | number)\n- height?: number | string\n- rowHeight?: number\n- headerHeight?: number\n- virtualized?: boolean\n- bordered?: boolean\n- striped?: boolean\n- hoverable?: boolean\n- sortKey?: string\n- sortDirection?: \"asc\" | \"desc\"\n- filters?: Record<string, string | number> — What was typed into each column's filter input, by column key.\n- selectedKeys?: Set<string | number>\n- selectionMode?: \"none\" | \"single\" | \"multiple\"\n- loading?: boolean\n- emptyMessage?: node\n- ariaLabel?: string — Accessible name for the grid\nEvents (write @name={…}; the prop is onName):\n- @sort\n- @filterChange\n- @selectionChange\n- @cellEdit\nChildren: none (configure it with props).\nEvery component also takes style and className.\nMinimal usage: <DataGrid columns={[]} data={[]} />",
